WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
The prerequisite medium bomb is lit beside Ryu.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.900
Ryu guards the medium-to-heavy target.

3
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.050
Sprint’s heavy-kick overhead hits after the blocked target.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.850
The existing bomb launches Ryu after the overhead.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.500
Jumping medium punch extends the bomb juggle.

6
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.450
Air OD Bushin continues the juggle.

7
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.050
Medium bomb plant spends one additional can.

8
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:05.250
Ryu rises beside the replanted medium bomb.
